            <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 14:03:26 +1200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}.rn{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,"SF Pro Text",sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:4px 2px}.rn h1{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 10px}.rn h2{font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 6px}.rn ul{margin:6px 0;padding-left:20px}.rn li{margin-bottom:7px}.rn code{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.rn{color:#e8e8ed}}</style><div class="rn"><h1>Rein 0.8.5</h1>
<ul>
<li><b>No more silent wait when casting.</b> Full-quality casting converts your file first (30–60 seconds for a film) — the player and menu-bar controls now appear immediately with a "Preparing full quality…" status, instead of nothing happening until playback starts.</li>
</ul></div>
]]></description>
